	### A trophy's row picture (Trophies, Held Abroad, Trophies on Display): its
	### monument's picture (gm_tr_picture) and over it the trophy's own, what was
	### carried off on display in a museum room, when its landmark has one drawn
	### (gm_tr_disp_trophy_picture_code above 0; gm_tr_picture_trophies). Added
	### 2026-10-16. A secondary monument's row (gm_mon_row_site) is no trophy and
	### keeps gm_tr_picture alone.
